{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:35:00+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SpiderHeck", "steam_appid": 1329500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2156362], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.poster.avif?t=1785516646\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.webm?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.mp4?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A fast physics-based brawler where you'll get dozens of &quot;holy heck, did I just do that? that was so cool&quot; moments.</strong><br><br><strong>One-hit death</strong><br>One wrong move and you are out! With 25 weapons as dangerous to you as they are to your enemies, every battle feels like dancing on a razor’s edge.<br><br><strong>Web swinging &amp; wall crawling</strong><br>Run on ceilings and ramp up wild speed using physics-based web swinging.<br><br><strong>Wild maps</strong><br>55 maps to keep your fights fresh with various physics obstacles or hazards, and you can always grab more from the Steam Workshop!<br><br><strong>Versus</strong><br>Battle friends and randoms in intense acrobatic showdowns or epicly clumsy battles.<br><br><strong>Co-op</strong><br>Fight off waves of enemies, slowly gaining various upgrades as you try your best to “avoid” friendly fire.<br><br><strong>Play alone</strong><br>Test your skills by completing a variety of themed combat and parkour challenges.<br><br><strong>Editor</strong><br>Design your own versus maps, parkour courses, and combat challenges to test yourself or your friends.<br><br><strong>Customization</strong><br>The spiders are bald - help them unlock cool hats by completing achievements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.poster.avif?t=1785516646\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.webm?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.mp4?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Disclaimer: this is not Australia simulator.</i>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.poster.avif?t=1785516646\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.webm?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/e510aed1a0a7a85bc704ff456425028b.mp4?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A fast physics-based brawler where you'll get dozens of &quot;holy heck, did I just do that? that was so cool&quot; moments.</strong><br><br><strong>One-hit death</strong><br>One wrong move and you are out! With 25 weapons as dangerous to you as they are to your enemies, every battle feels like dancing on a razor’s edge.<br><br><strong>Web swinging &amp; wall crawling</strong><br>Run on ceilings and ramp up wild speed using physics-based web swinging.<br><br><strong>Wild maps</strong><br>55 maps to keep your fights fresh with various physics obstacles or hazards, and you can always grab more from the Steam Workshop!<br><br><strong>Versus</strong><br>Battle friends and randoms in intense acrobatic showdowns or epicly clumsy battles.<br><br><strong>Co-op</strong><br>Fight off waves of enemies, slowly gaining various upgrades as you try your best to “avoid” friendly fire.<br><br><strong>Play alone</strong><br>Test your skills by completing a variety of themed combat and parkour challenges.<br><br><strong>Editor</strong><br>Design your own versus maps, parkour courses, and combat challenges to test yourself or your friends.<br><br><strong>Customization</strong><br>The spiders are bald - help them unlock cool hats by completing achievements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.poster.avif?t=1785516646\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.webm?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/extras/d78e0add9875de50bcf3d2682c22c830.mp4?t=1785516646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Disclaimer: this is not Australia simulator.</i>", "short_description": "Spiders with laser swords! Duel to the death against your friends or choose to team up and hold back swarms of savage enemies. Swing, stab and shoot with style, effortlessly performing movie-worthy parkour.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1329500/header.jpg?t=1785516646", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_